  "details": "1. Launch VRChat\n\n2. Join a world\n\n3. Open your settings\n\n4. Enable logging\n\n5. Click the \"share logs\" button (or the \"share all logs\" button)\n\n6. Nothing happens!\n\n7. Connect your phone over USB\n\n8. Navigate to `Internal Storage/Documents/Logs`\n\n9. The folder is empty!\n\nThis is happening both on my phone (Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra) and my tablet (Samsung Galaxy Tab S7+), even after reinstalling VRChat.",
